# Agent Outputs

This folder contains AI-generated outputs from the FDE Vault Agent Platform.

**IMPORTANT:** This is the ONLY folder where the MVP may write generated content.

Generated outputs include:
- Workflow drafts (Grill Me Reviews, Implementation Plans, Solution Briefs)
- Knowledge Refresh reports
- Research summaries
- Other AI-generated artifacts

All generated content must include the required metadata front matter and go through GitHub PR review before promotion to other vault folders.
